# prometheus-elasticsearch-exporter server arguments
#
# Description: Command-line arguments to pass to the prometheus-elasticsearch-exporter server.
#
# NOTE on escaping:
# - Due to shell escaping, to pass backslashes for regexes, you need to double them
#   (\\\\d for \d).
# - If running under systemd, you need to double them again (\\\\\\\\d to mean \d),
#   and escape newlines too.
#
# Default: empty string (no extra arguments)
ARGS="{{ (args | default('')) | default('') }}"